Serve as a Beacon of the Light

The Oath of the Holy unites Paladins who nurture life and use the power of the Light for healing and support. They combine great piety and virtue with martial skill, aspiring to the highest standards of morality, service to others, and self-sacrifice.

These paladins share the following tenets:

Live your life in service to others of goodwill.
Do all in your power to ease the suffering of the innocent.
Let the Light shine through you to banish the darkness.
Level 3: Oath of the Holy Spells
The magic of your oath ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Paladin level specified in the Oath of the Holy Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.

Oath of the Holy Spells
Paladin	Spells
3	Cure Wounds, Healing Word
5	Lesser Restoration, Prayer of Healing
